*.jl.cov
# Julia/, Plugins/ and VSCode/ were ignored here while each was its own
# repository checked out inside this one. They are content now, not nested
# repos, so those rules are gone -- leaving them would silently exclude the
# entire monorepo from `git add`.

# Workspace-private. This repository is the development home, but these
# files describe how the workspace is run rather than what the packages do,
# and they stay on the maintainer's disk. They were filtered out of history
# at the migration, so committing them now would publish them for the first
# time. Root-anchored: a package's own CLAUDE.md is unaffected.
/PLANS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
/Docs/
/Assets/
/Tools/
/Environments/
*.jl.*.cov
*.jl.mem
deps/deps.jl

.fake

# Nested independent git repos — each has its own .git and GitHub remote.
# This root repo versions only the workspace-level files (Docs, Assets,
# Environments, guidelines).

# Stray tool output
acad.err
jqerr.txt
